**Drop‑off:** Milan Malpensa Airport (MXP) – 17:00 on 27 Nov 2024  

Below is the vehicle that best matches the requested dates, times and locations, together with the supplier’s rating and a selection of recent traveller comments. All figures come from the live car‑rental API (search‑key `eyJkcml2ZXJzQWdlIjozMC…`).

---

## 🚗 Vehicle & Rental Summary  

| Item | Details |
|------|---------|
| **Supplier** | **Goldcar** (large European car‑rental brand) |
