| **One‑way fee** | **€ 120** (already built into the quoted price) |
| **Deposit / Damage excess** | € 950 deposit (refunded on return) – € 1 100 damage excess (optional reduction available) |
| **Total price (drive‑away)** | **USD 52.89** (≈ € 48) for the whole 7‑day period – **≈ USD 7.55 / day** |
| **Cancellation** | Free up to 48 h before pick‑up; after that a € 50 fee applies |
| **Vehicle specs** | 4 seats, 2‑door/4‑door layout, air‑conditioning, unlimited km, manual transmission, small‑suitcase capacity (0 big / 0 small) |

