| **Oct 16** | 9.7 | Solo traveller | *“Good car in good conditions – but many new security features are annoying.”* | “Good car in good conditions. Each time I switched on the engine I had to disable all those stupid new ‘security’ features that create a lot of distractions for the driver.” |
