| **Oct 12** | 8 (from the “reviews” endpoint) | – | *“Smooth pick‑up, clean car.”* | “The staff at Fiumicino were friendly and got me on the road quickly. The Smart Forfour was spotless and very easy to drive in Rome’s narrow streets.” |
| **Sep 28** | 7 (from the “reviews” endpoint) | – | *“Great value for a road‑trip.”* | “Unlimited mileage let us explore Tuscany without worrying about extra fees. The car was fuel‑efficient and returned to Malpensa without any issues.” |
| **Sep 15** | 6 (from the “reviews” endpoint) | – | *“Manual gearbox took some getting used to.”* | “The transmission was a bit stiff at first, but after a short warm‑up it worked fine. Overall a decent car for the price.” |
| **Aug 30** | 7 (from the “reviews” endpoint) | – | *“Helpful staff, clear instructions.”* | “The drop‑off instructions at Malpensa were clear. The car was in good condition and the one‑way fee was reasonable.” |
